        "answer": "During 2025, the cancellation rate by recorded order date ranged from approximately 5.614554% to 6.449646% for the first 40 days of the year. For example, on 2025-01-01, there were 529 cancelled orders out of 8,202 total orders, resulting in a cancellation rate of 6.449646%. On 2025-01-10, the rate was 5.614554% (645 cancelled out of 11,488 total). This means that, on average, about 6% of orders were cancelled each day during this period. The population for each date is all orders recorded on that date, and the unit is percentage of orders cancelled. Interpretation: The daily cancellation rate was relatively stable, with minor fluctuations, indicating consistent customer or operational behavior regarding cancellations in early 2025.",
